cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite this software, together with the articles in which the objects and the
  morphing procedure were introduced (see references).
title: NGL BlobMorph
abstract: >-
  MATLAB and Python tools that create morph matrices (morph levels x stimulus
  sizes) between the three-dimensional "blob" objects of Zoccolan et al. (2009),
  following the procedure of Rhee et al. (2025).
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ballesteros
    given-names: Jesus J.
    email: jesusjballesteros@gmail.com
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
